# Panic-by-default preserved: an overflow OUTSIDE a fault-catch still panics
# (exit 1) exactly as today (error-model.md §11.1 item 3). The harness asserts
# the binary exits non-zero with the `integer overflow` message.
void main():
    int x = 9223372036854775807
    int y = x * 2
    print(f"{y}")
